{"id": 5596, "name": "Adams City Park and Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.adamsmn.com/campground.html", "lines": ["nt | Adams City Park and Campground | The campground opened May 1st for the season! | ​​ | The campground is a first come, first served campground. There are 14 camping locations with water and electric hookup. It costs $25 a night to camp. There is a sewer dumping station that is located by the City Park entrance. If you are using a vehicle to 'hold' your camping spot, you will be charged a night of camping for hold", "ms Park Campground payment information: There is a mailbox attached to the information board that holds payment envelopes. Payment is based on the honor system. On the envelope, mark the number of nights stayed. Cost is $25.00 per night. Put the envelope with your payment into one of the payment boxes attached to either the information board or the bathroom/showering facility. | ​ | ​The City of Adams completed a pro", "d a new showering and bathroom facility, the addition of 7 campsites and other improvements which brought the park into compliance with ADA standards. To fund this project the City of Adams applied for and was awarded a $75,100.00 FY22 Outdoor Recreation Grant through the Minnesota Department of Natural Resources, which the City of Adams matched dollar for dollar. Powered by Create your own unique website with custom"]}]}
