{"id": 5605, "name": "Barsness Park Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.ci.glenwood.mn.us/parks", "lines": ["k Camping season May 1st- September 30th | CAMPING CLOSED FOR THE 2026 SEASON | THANKS FOR A GREAT YEAR! | ​ | CAMPING RESERVATIONS FOR 2027 WILL | OPEN ONLINE APRIL 1, 2027 | ​ | Campsite Fees | | Full Hookup sites are $55 per night Water and Electrical sites are $50 per night Tent sites are $35 per night, ONE additional tent can be pitched for a fee of $35, maximum of two tents per site. For Campsite Information, p", "027 WILL | OPEN ONLINE APRIL 1, 2027 | ​ | Campsite Fees | | Full Hookup sites are $55 per night Water and Electrical sites are $50 per night Tent sites are $35 per night, ONE additional tent can be pitched for a fee of $35, maximum of two tents per site. For Campsite Information, please refer to our online camping site. Our cancellation policy is listed above. Golf Carts are allowed with a City Permit. More informat", " include refrigeration and cooking facilities, restrooms, and picnic tables. These buildings provide an excellent spot for gatherings of all kinds: graduations, family reunions, grooms dinners, etc. The Chalet rents for $150/day and the Glenhaven Shelter rents for $125/day: (8am-6pm). We ask for a $150/day damage deposit at the time of rental, which is returned once the building is inspected by a member of the Parks ", "uth Firearms Safety Training programs, and various conceal-and-carry courses. To access or utilize the Glenwood Shooting Range, a Single One-Day Pass and/or an Annual Pass shall be required. | | A Single One-Day Pass is $15 (Adult and Youth) and may be purchased from: The City of Glenwood, at 100 17th Avenue NW, Monday - Friday 8:00 AM - 4:00 PM, or Pope County Law Enforcement (Dispatch) at the Pope County Courthouse", " or Pope County Law Enforcement (Dispatch) at the Pope County Courthouse, 130 East Minnesota Avenue, Glenwood, 320-634-5411, Monday - Friday after 4:00 PM, or during the day, Saturday and Sunday. An Annual Adult Pass is $75 per year, per individual, a Youth Annual Pass is $35 per year per individual and may be purchased from the City of Glenwood at 100 17th Avenue NW Glenwood, 320-634-5433, Monday - Friday, 8:00 AM -"]}]}
