ite (50amp electric/Water/Sewer) | $51 per night for Residents of Wright County | $61 per night for Non-Res", "ty | $40 per night for Non-Residents | Full Service Campsite (50amp electric/Water/Sewer) | $35 per night for Residents of Wright County | $43 per night for Non-Residents | Tandem Campsite (50amp electric/Water/Sewer) | $51 per night for Residents of Wright County | $61 per night for Non-Residents | A $6 reservation fee applies to all reservable campsites and cabins. | | | Location: | Two main parking areas are avail"]}, {"url": "https://www.wrightcountymn.gov/Facilities/FeatureOverview", "lines": [], "via": "Feature Overview"}, {"url": "https://www.wrightcountymn.gov/DocumentCenter/View/30514/Bertram-Campground-Map-and-Information?bidId=", "pdf": true, "via": "Bertram Campground Map and Information"}, {"url": "https://www.wrightcountymn.gov/FormCenter/Parks-Forms-19/Trackchair-Reservation-Form-120", "lines": [], "via": "Trackchair Reservation Request"}, {"url": "https://www.wrightcountymn.gov/DocumentCenter/View/23379/Camper-Cabin-Rental-RulesGuidelines?bidId=", "pdf": true, "via": "Camper Cabin Rental Rules"}]}
{"id": 5611, "name": "Big Falls Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://bigfalls.govoffice.com/campgrounds", "lines": []}, {"url": "https://bigfalls.govoffice.com/lodging", "lines": [], "via": "Lodging"}, {"url": "https://bigfalls.govoffice.com/index.asp?SEC=D10F2ACA-9350-454B-8C65-C031379E456B", "lines": ["e sites offer electric and water hook-ups. They have tether lines at each site for your horses. | Riverside Event Pavilion: Our riverside pavilion is perfect for any event. Host a reunion, wedding or any large event for $175 per day and $250 Deposit. For Event Pavilion reservations please contact the city clerk at (218)276-3300. | For reservations, please call our camp host at 218-556-4825. | | | 410 2nd Street NW PO"], "via": "Campgrounds"}, {"url": "https://bigfalls.govoffice.com/index.asp?SEC=ECB70D23-D6F2-4ACD-A2E9-D26CF3051A4E&DE=90956D49-5F46-44F4-8709-D1ABEE226515", "lines": ["room and shower facilities. | Boat and canoe access is available at the river. Fishing from shore is also a great option! | Swimming in the \"deep hole\" or small rapids is a very unique experience! | The fee for camping: $44.15 (includes tax/fees) per night with electric and water hookup and $31.84 (includes tax/fees) per night for a primitive site. If you stay a whole week, the 7th night is free! Contact us for month", "whole week, the 7th night is free! Contact us for monthly rates. The complete policy and site maps are available in the links below. | An RV Dump station is available on site and is free for registered guest. There is a $10 fee for non-registered guests. | Contact our Camp Host at: (218)556-4825 | RESERVATIONS: | Click here: Make Reservations | Reservations can be made up to one year in advance. | Campground Policy R"], "via": "Campground Information."}, {"url": "https://bigfalls.govoffice.com/index.asp?SEC=ECB70D23-D6F2-4ACD-A2E9-D26CF3051A4E&DE=4149F25B-F33C-4D43-A63A-662C9B5FA412", "lines": ["pground. | We have over 30 miles of marked multi-use trails. Plus, there are miles and miles of beautiful trails to explore on your own in the Heart of the Northern Minnesota Wilderness. | The fee for nightly camping is $44.15 (includes tax/fees). | Reservations in May - October can be made by following this link: Make Reservations | We will accept reservations up to one year in advance. | Horse Camp Site Map 410 2nd"], "via": "Horse Camp Information."}]}
