{"id": 5681, "name": "Riverside Park Municipal Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.saintpetermn.gov/490/Camping", "lines": ["rstand that power limitations may affect the use of certain appliances (e.g., air conditioning, microwaves, refrigerators). We recommend checking your RV’s power requirements before booking. | Camp sites with electric - $30 per night | Tent site with no electric - $20 per night | Check out is at 11 a.m. and check in is at Noon | Rules and Regulations (pdf) | Facilities | | | 11 Camper/Electric Sites | 5 Tent Sites | ", " Monday - Friday | 8:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m. | | After-Hours Voicemail: (507) 934-0673 | Cancellation Policy | Contact the Recreation Office | Must be requested 2 business days prior to the reservation | Full refund minus a $3 administration fee | | | Email | Reserve Site Online | | | Make a Payment | Agenda Center | Careers | Permits & Licenses | Report a Concern | Alerts & Notifications | | | | | | | Contact Us | City "]}, {"url": "https://www.saintpetermn.gov/211/Utility-Billing", "lines": ["ay prior to the Disconnect Date as specified on the notice. | Disconnects occur weekly for failed payment arrangements. | Reconnect Fees | Reconnection charges for accounts paid by 3:30 p.m. on regular business days are $75.51. | Reconnect charges include sales tax. | Electric & Water Meter Readings | Electric and water meters are read each month starting around the 8th of the month. Meter readers read for approximat", "e can set up a special meter reading. Please make arrangements to be home when your final meter reading occurs so we can read both the inside and outside meters. Meters are not read on Saturday, Sunday, or holidays. | A $100 deposit is required of all renters or owners if you do not own the actual property on which the residence is located. This deposit will be returned to you when you move from the property and your"], "via": "Utility Services and Billing"}, {"url": "https://secure.rec1.com/MN/stpeter-mn/catalog", "lines": []}]}
